{
  "title": "ISic001336. Funerary inscription",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al0-interpretive\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al1-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΝΕ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΙΝΕΣ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἐκ\">ἐκ]</span>  <span data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">[τ-]<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[ῶν]</span>  <span data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ἰδίων</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[ἐποίησεν]</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"τόπον\">[τό]π̣ον</span>  <span data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[ἑ]α[υτῷ]</span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span data-text=\"καί\">καί</span>  <span data-text=\"τοῖς\">τοῖς</span>  <span data-text=\"ἰδίος\">ἰδίος</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al0-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΝΕ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΙΝΕΣ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἐκ\">..</span><span data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">.]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[..]</span><span data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ΙΔΙΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[........]</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"τόπον\">[..].ΟΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[.]Α[...]</span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[............]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: <span>ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐποίησεν Ferrua</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 4\">line.4: <span>ΙΟΝ .. Α Amico, Kaibel; [τό]π̣ον [ἑ]α[υτῷ Ferrua</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 5\">line.5: <span>[καὶ τοῖς ἰδίοις Ferrua</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>… built it at his own expense for himself and his children.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>According to Ferrua’s restorations (1941, 243), the epitaph includes a reference to the construction of the funerary monument at the deceased's own expense, for himself and his descendants. A less likely, though still possible, restoration is <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐγόρασεν</span> (cf. IG XIV 529, ll. 4–5). On the formula fecit sibis et suis, which at Catania is attested exclusively in Christian funerary inscriptions, see Ferrua 1941, 242–243.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Amico 1741 277 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186</a></li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">516</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li><li> Ferrua 1941 243 n.2 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001456\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001456</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
  "divs": [
    {
      "id": "editions",
      "html": "<div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al0-interpretive\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al1-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΝΕ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΙΝΕΣ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἐκ\">ἐκ]</span>  <span data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">[τ-]<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[ῶν]</span>  <span data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ἰδίων</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[ἐποίησεν]</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"τόπον\">[τό]π̣ον</span>  <span data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[ἑ]α[υτῷ]</span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span data-text=\"καί\">καί</span>  <span data-text=\"τοῖς\">τοῖς</span>  <span data-text=\"ἰδίος\">ἰδίος</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al0-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΝΕ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΙΝΕΣ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἐκ\">..</span><span data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">.]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[..]</span><span data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ΙΔΙΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[........]</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"τόπον\">[..].ΟΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[.]Α[...]</span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[............]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apparatus",
      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: <span>ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐποίησεν Ferrua</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 4\">line.4: <span>ΙΟΝ .. Α Amico, Kaibel; [τό]π̣ον [ἑ]α[υτῷ Ferrua</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 5\">line.5: <span>[καὶ τοῖς ἰδίοις Ferrua</span></span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>… built it at his own expense for himself and his children.</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p>According to Ferrua’s restorations (1941, 243), the epitaph includes a reference to the construction of the funerary monument at the deceased's own expense, for himself and his descendants. A less likely, though still possible, restoration is <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐγόρασεν</span> (cf. IG XIV 529, ll. 4–5). On the formula fecit sibis et suis, which at Catania is attested exclusively in Christian funerary inscriptions, see Ferrua 1941, 242–243.</p>  "
    },
